<title>Sync Action Invoker Namespace</title>

The <action>Sync</action> namespace, part of the <link action_invoker.csdoc>Action Invoker</link>, provides actions to interact with <link sync_services.csdoc>synchronization services</link>.

After creating a connection to a synchronization service, a <link action_invoker_resource_ids.csdoc>resource ID</link> is returned that identifies the service in subsequent actions until the connection is closed.


